  storyLines:
  - You are an autonomous robotic rover sent from Earth.
  - 'Mission: explore the Martian surface and gather scientific data.'
  - This environment is hostile. Survival is critical to mission success.
  - Your objective is to analyse Martian samples.
  - Scan the terrain to identify points of interest.
  - Extract samples and analyse them on-site.
  - Your adventure has start.
  - Good luck, rover.
